raw_text = "~ start
Game dev: well well well
Game dev: you know that you were not suppost to be here right?
- No?
	You: No?
Game dev: its seem like you donno
Game dev: let just say you were try to find a loophole in the map
Game dev: when you see the void , you decided to jump and think you will escape from this nightmare?
- I'm so so sorry
	You: I'm so so sorry
You: I donno becasue this is my first time playing this game.
Game dev: Is it?
Game dev: ...
Game dev:  Well since this is yours fisrt time
Game dev: I'll let you go
Game dev: BUT
Game dev: If you think you try to outsmart this game again
Game dev: hehehe
Game dev: let just said you have no second chance
Game dev: So yeah , I will move you back then
Game dev: So good luck
=> END"
